  "canon:title": "Etoposide-related myocardial infarction.",
  "canon:abstract": "The occurrence of a myocardial infarction is reported after chemotherapy containing etoposide, in a man with no risk factors for coronary heart disease. Possible causal mechanisms are discussed.",
